{"seq":3,"slug":"periodic-table","title":"高一化学 — 元素周期表","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/year-1/chemistry/atomic-structure/periodic-table","wordCount":2043,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"高一化学-元素周期表\">高一化学 — 元素周期表</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>1869年，俄国化学家门捷列夫将当时已知的63种元素按原子量递增的顺序排列，发现元素的性质呈现出周期性变化，由此编制了第一张元素周期表。这张表不仅系统地整理了已有的化学知识，还成功预言了当时尚未发现的几种元素的存在和性质。如今的元素周期表以原子序数（质子数）为排列依据，共包含118种元素，是化学科学最重要的工具之一。理解周期表的结构规律，就等于掌握了预测和解释元素性质的一把万能钥匙。</p>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"一-周期表的结构\">一、周期表的结构</h3><p>现代元素周期表由<strong>7个周期</strong>（横行）和<strong>18个族</strong>（纵列）构成。</p>\n<p><strong>周期</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>周期</th>\n<th>元素序数范围</th>\n<th>元素种数</th>\n<th>类别</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>第1周期</td>\n<td>1-2</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>短周期</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>第2周期</td>\n<td>3-10</td>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>短周期</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>第3周期</td>\n<td>11-18</td>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>短周期</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>第4周期</td>\n<td>19-36</td>\n<td>18</td>\n<td>长周期</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>第5周期</td>\n<td>37-54</td>\n<td>18</td>\n<td>长周期</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>第6周期</td>\n<td>55-86</td>\n<td>32</td>\n<td>长周期</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>第7周期</td>\n<td>87-118</td>\n<td>32</td>\n<td>长周期（已填满）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>每一周期中元素种数的变化规律为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>8</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>8</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>18</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>18</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>32</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>32</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2, 8, 8, 18, 18, 32, 32</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">18</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">18</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">32</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">32</span></span></span></span></span>，这些数字正好是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>4</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>4</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2 \\times 1^2, 2 \\times 2^2, 2 \\times 2^2, 2 \\times 3^2, 2 \\times 3^2, 2 \\times 4^2, 2 \\times 4^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0085em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0085em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0085em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0085em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0085em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0085em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<p><strong>族的分类</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>族类</th>\n<th>包含的族</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>主族（A族）</td>\n<td>IA-VIIA</td>\n<td>由短周期和长周期元素共同组成</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>副族（B族）</td>\n<td>IIIB-VIIB, IB, IIB</td>\n<td>仅由长周期元素组成</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>第VIII族</td>\n<td>第8、9、10列</td>\n<td>铁系和铂系元素</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>零族</td>\n<td>第18列</td>\n<td>稀有气体元素</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"二-元素周期律\">二、元素周期律</h3><p><strong>元素周期律</strong>：元素的性质随着原子序数的递增而呈周期性变化。</p>\n<p>这种周期性变化的根本原因是<strong>核外电子排布的周期性变化</strong>——每一周期从左到右，最外层电子数从1递增到8（第1周期从1到2），到达稀有气体时最外层达到稳定结构，下一周期从新的电子层开始填充。</p>\n<p><strong>具体表现</strong>：</p>\n<p><strong>（一）原子半径的周期性变化</strong></p>\n<p>同一周期从左到右：核电荷数增大，对外层电子的吸引力增强，原子半径逐渐<strong>减小</strong>（稀有气体除外）。</p>\n<p>同一主族从上到下：电子层数增多，原子半径逐渐<strong>增大</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>（二）元素主要化合价的周期性变化</strong></p>\n<p>同一周期从左到右，最高正化合价从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">+1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">+</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 递增到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">+7</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">+</span><span class=\"mord\">7</span></span></span></span></span>（O、F 没有正价），最低负化合价从第IVA族的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span></span></span></span> 到第VIIA族的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<p>关系式：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mtext>最高正价</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mtext>最低负价</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|最高正价| + |最低负价| = 8</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">最高正价</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">最低负价</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span></span></span></span></span>（第IVA族至第VIIA族）</p>\n<p><strong>（三）金属性和非金属性的周期性变化</strong></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>变化方向</th>\n<th>金属性</th>\n<th>非金属性</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>同一周期从左到右</td>\n<td>减弱</td>\n<td>增强</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>同一主族从上到下</td>\n<td>增强</td>\n<td>减弱</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"三-金属性和非金属性的判断依据\">三、金属性和非金属性的判断依据</h3><p><strong>金属性强弱的判断</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>判据</th>\n<th>金属性强</th>\n<th>金属性弱</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>与水/酸反应</td>\n<td>反应剧烈</td>\n<td>反应不剧烈或不反应</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>最高价氧化物对应水化物</td>\n<td>碱性强</td>\n<td>碱性弱</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>置换反应</td>\n<td>能置换出较弱金属</td>\n<td>被较强金属置换</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>失电子难易</td>\n<td>容易失去电子</td>\n<td>不容易失去电子</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>非金属性强弱的判断</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>判据</th>\n<th>非金属性强</th>\n<th>非金属性弱</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>H</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{H}_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">H</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 化合</td>\n<td>反应条件温和、产物稳定</td>\n<td>反应条件苛刻、产物不稳定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>最高价氧化物对应水化物</td>\n<td>酸性强</td>\n<td>酸性弱</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>置换反应</td>\n<td>能从化合物中置换出较弱非金属</td>\n<td>被较强非金属置换</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>得电子难易</td>\n<td>容易得到电子</td>\n<td>不容易得到电子</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"四-同周期和同主族元素性质递变实例\">四、同周期和同主族元素性质递变实例</h3><p><strong>第三周期元素性质递变</strong>：</p>\n<p>以第三周期为例（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Na</mtext><mo>→</mo><mtext>Cl</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Na} \\to \\text{Cl}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Na</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Cl</span></span></span></span></span></span>）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>元素</th>\n<th>Na</th>\n<th>Mg</th>\n<th>Al</th>\n<th>Si</th>\n<th>P</th>\n<th>S</th>\n<th>Cl</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>最高正价</td>\n<td>+1</td>\n<td>+2</td>\n<td>+3</td>\n<td>+4</td>\n<td>+5</td>\n<td>+6</td>\n<td>+7</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>最高价氧化物</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>Na</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub><mtext>O</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Na}_2\\text{O}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Na</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mor