/span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（强酸）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>碱性逐渐减弱，酸性逐渐增强——这正是金属性减弱、非金属性增强的体现。</p>\n<p><strong>第IA族碱金属性质递变</strong>：</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Li</mtext><mo>→</mo><mtext>Na</mtext><mo>→</mo><mtext>K</mtext><mo>→</mo><mtext>Rb</mtext><mo>→</mo><mtext>Cs</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Li} \\to \\text{Na} \\to \\text{K} \\to \\text{Rb} \\to \\text{Cs}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Li</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Na</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">K</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Rb</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Cs</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p>从上到下：原子半径增大 → 最外层电子越容易失去 → 金属性增强。表现为：与水反应越来越剧烈（锂缓慢、钠较快、钾燃烧），对应氢氧化物碱性越来越强。</p>\n<h3 id=\"五-元素周期表的分区\">五、元素周期表的分区</h3><p>根据最后填入电子的轨道类型，周期表可分为几个区域：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>分区</th>\n<th>填入的能级</th>\n<th>位置</th>\n<th>代表元素</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span> 区</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">ns</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>左侧（IA、IIA族）</td>\n<td>Li、Na、Mg、Ca</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 区</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">np</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>右侧（IIIA-VIIA族、零族）</td>\n<td>B、C、N、O、Cl</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span> 区</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(n-1)d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>中部（IIIB-VIIB、VIII族）</td>\n<td>Fe、Cu、Zn</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span> 区</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(n-2)f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>下方独立行</td>\n<td>镧系、锕系</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"六-周期表的应用\">六、周期表的应用</h3><p>元素周期表是化学家最重要的工具：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>预测未知元素的性质</strong>：根据元素在周期表中的位置推断其性质</li>\n<li><strong>寻找新材料</strong>：在金属与非金属交界区寻找半导体材料</li>\n<li><strong>寻找催化剂</strong>：过渡金属区是重要催化剂的来源</li>\n<li><strong>寻找新药物</strong>：同族元素的化合物常有类似的生物活性</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li><p>某元素位于第三周期第VA族，写出它的元素符号、原子序数和电子排布式。预测它的最高正价和最低负价。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>比较下列各组元素的金属性或非金属性强弱：(1) Na、Mg、Al；(2) F、Cl、Br；(3) Na、K、Rb。说明你的判断依据。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>为什么 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>Al(OH)</mtext><mn>3</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Al(OH)}_3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0497em;vertical-align:-0.2997em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Al(OH)</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是两性氢氧化物（既能与酸反应也能与碱反应），而 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>NaOH</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{NaOH}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">NaOH</span></span></span></span></span></span> 只是碱、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>H</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mtext>SiO</mtext><mn>3</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{H}_2\\text{SiO}_3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">H</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">SiO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 只是酸？从 Al 在周期表中的位置解释。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>某元素 X 的最高价氧化物对应的水化物为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>H</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mtext>XO</mtext><mn>4</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{H}_2\\text{XO}_4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">H</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">XO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，X 的氢化物为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>H</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub><mtext>X</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{H}_2\\text{X}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">H</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">X</span></span></span></span></span></span>。判断 X 位于哪一族，写出两种可能的元素。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>思考：门捷列夫当年预言了&quot;类铝&quot;&quot;类硼&quot;&quot;类硅&quot;三种未发现的元素，后来都被发现（分别是镓Ga、钪Sc、锗Ge）。这说明了元素周期表怎样的科学价值？</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><p>门捷列夫编制周期表时，不惧将某些元素的位置与按原子量排列的顺序对调（如碲与碘），以维护性质的周期性。后来莫塞莱在1913年发现，决定元素化学性质的不是原子量而是原子序数（核电荷数），证明了门捷列夫的直觉是正确的。现代周期表的第七周期已经在2016年全部填满，第118号元素被命名为&quot;鿫&quot;（Oganesson，Og）。科学家们正在尝试合成更重的第119号和第120号元素，探索所谓的&quot;稳定岛&quot;——理论预言在某些特定质子数和中子数的组合处，超重元素可能具有远超预期的稳定性。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>元素周期表以原子序数为排列依据，分为7个周期和18个族。周期律的本质是核外电子排布的周期性变化。同一周期从左到右金属性减弱、非金属性增强、原子半径减小；同一主族从上到下金属性增强、非金属性减弱、原子半径增大。金属性和非金属性可通过与水/酸的反应、最高价氧化物对应水化物的酸碱性、置换反应等实验来判断。理解并熟练运用周期表的结构和规律，是高中化学学习的核心能力。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"高一化学 — 元素周期表","id":"高一化学-元素周期表"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"一、周期表的结构","id":"一-周期表的结构"},{"level":3,"text":"二、元素周期律","id":"二-元素周期律"},{"level":3,"text":"三、金属性和非金属性的判断依据","id":"三-金属性和非金属性的判断依据"},{"level":3,"text":"四、同周期和同主族元素性质递变实例","id":"四-同周期和同主族元素性质递变实例"},{"level":3,"text":"五、元素周期表的分区","id":"五-元素周期表的分区"},{"level":3,"text":"六、周期表的应用","id":"六-周期表的应用"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"高一化学 — 电子排布","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/year-1/chemistry/atomic-structure/electron-config"},"next":{"title":"高一化学 — 离子键","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/year-1/chemistry/chemical-bonding/ionic-bonds"}}